DESCRIPTION:Gulf Place's Town Green and public beach host a Halloween race
  night with three separate events: the Wicked Walk Parade at 6 PM\, the M
 onster Mash Dash at 6:30\, and the Haunted Hustle 5K at 7. Prices rise as
  the date gets closer\, from $15 for the Wicked Walk and $20 for the Mons
 ter Mash Dash early on to $20 and $25 at the door\, with the 5K running $
 30 in advance up to $40 on race day. Costumed racers can expect a live DJ
 \, face painting and balloon artists alongside the run\, and proceeds sup
 port the Dolphin Foundation for Education and Arts.\nPrice: from $15\nAre
 a: Orange Beach & Gulf Shores\nTimes: Saturday 10/17 · 6:00 PM\nhttps://
